    <p class="title is-5 mathjax">
      
        Data Augmentation for Cognitive Behavioral Therapy: Leveraging ERNIE <span class="search-hit mathjax">Language</span> <span class="search-hit mathjax">Models</span> using Artificial Intelligence
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Sambana%2C+B">Bosubabu Sambana</a>, 
      
